#
# 8. CONCLUSION
# --------------
# The MW–M31 halo movie pipeline represents a comprehensive, 
# reproducible, and publication-ready framework for visualizing 
# time-resolved dark matter halo evolution. By generating separate 
# movies for shape, density, velocity anisotropy, rotation, and 
# spin, the methodology avoids visual clutter and maximizes 
# physical insight. This approach complements traditional 
# time-series plots and provides an intuitive, dynamic view of 
# halo merger physics.
